  "about": "Alongside recovery snapshot: compatible compact-thread-list UX and Agent Service official images, private numeric resource route, additive ChatGPT provider bootstrap with host-dashboard usage plumbing, rerun-mode preservation and non-destructive Tailscale login setup. Session/history sharing remains opt-in. This is source/image verification, not completed user-run or universal installation acceptance.",
